# Mind's Desire: "Until end of turn, you may play that card without paying its mana cost" (CR 118.9, 601.3). With
# three Moxen and a Black Lotus cast before it there are four copies, and every card of this all-Lightning-Bolt library
# (so the shuffle cannot matter) is exiled and may be cast: two Bolts are cast for nothing at Bot2 (20 -> 14), and no
# mana is spent. The permission ends with the turn: on turn 3 a third exiled Bolt is no longer castable (the refusal; the
# turn-1 casts are its positive control).

